    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buggos 2 is a swarm auto-battler RTS where you play as the evil sentient hivemind controlling a race of murderous bugs. You will conquer the dirty Humans by sending wave after wave of Buggos into their defenses until they crumble under your sheer biomass. Your objective is to gain control of all six planets within the solar system and completely wipe out the filthy Human presence within our new home sector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908500/extras/3928352689f456a77d75e19afa3d19cc.poster.avif?t=1753815241\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908500/extras/3928352689f456a77d75e19afa3d19cc.webm?t=1753815241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908500/extras/3928352689f456a77d75e19afa3d19cc.mp4?t=1753815241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission you complete will strengthen the swarm by unlocking evolution points. Each point allows you to evolve the Buggos into specialized units with unique abilities. There are over 150 evolutions for you to create the perfect swarm for each mission. You are allowed to re-specialize as many times as you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908500/extras/b62ae7b4d06fa8894065084620b42c3d.poster.avif?t=1753815241\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908500/extras/b62ae7b4d06fa8894065084620b42c3d.webm?t=1753815241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908500/extras/b62ae7b4d06fa8894065084620b42c3d.mp4?t=1753815241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you defeat an entire planet you are given a choice between three forced mutations. These upgrades are permanent for the run, and unlock some truly powerful evolutions that can reshape how the game is played. The humans will also gain new technology and weapons to fight back as you progress through the campaign.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908500/extras/fd01722ef79a5475beee447242694938.avif?t=1753815241\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Solar System Awaits its True Masters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908500/extras/0a11824a73fe5da92420f8f9521e508c.poster.avif?t=1753815241\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908500/extras/0a11824a73fe5da92420f8f9521e508c.webm?t=1753815241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908500/extras/0a11824a73fe5da92420f8f9521e508c.mp4?t=1753815241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist Buggos 2 on Steam and Prepare to Evolve, Command, and Conquer the disgusting Humans</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buggos 2 is a swarm auto-battler RTS where you play as the evil sentient hivemind controlling a race of murderous bugs. You will conquer the dirty Humans by sending wave after wave of Buggos into their defenses until they crumble under your sheer biomass. Your objective is to gain control of all six planets within the solar system and completely wipe out the filthy Human presence within our new home sector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908500/extras/3928352689f456a77d75e19afa3d19cc.poster.avif?t=1753815241\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908500/extras/3928352689f456a77d75e19afa3d19cc.webm?t=1753815241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908500/extras/3928352689f456a77d75e19afa3d19cc.mp4?t=1753815241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission you complete will strengthen the swarm by unlocking evolution points. Each point allows you to evolve the Buggos into specialized units with unique abilities. There are over 150 evolutions for you to create the perfect swarm for each mission. You are allowed to re-specialize as many times as you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908500/extras/b62ae7b4d06fa8894065084620b42c3d.poster.avif?t=1753815241\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908500/extras/b62ae7b4d06fa8894065084620b42c3d.webm?t=1753815241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908500/extras/b62ae7b4d06fa8894065084620b42c3d.mp4?t=1753815241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you defeat an entire planet you are given a choice between three forced mutations. These upgrades are permanent for the run, and unlock some truly powerful evolutions that can reshape how the game is played. The humans will also gain new technology and weapons to fight back as you progress through the campaign.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908500/extras/fd01722ef79a5475beee447242694938.avif?t=1753815241\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Solar System Awaits its True Masters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908500/extras/0a11824a73fe5da92420f8f9521e508c.poster.avif?t=1753815241\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908500/extras/0a11824a73fe5da92420f8f9521e508c.webm?t=1753815241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908500/extras/0a11824a73fe5da92420f8f9521e508c.mp4?t=1753815241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist Buggos 2 on Steam and Prepare to Evolve, Command, and Conquer the disgusting Humans</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Conquer and destroy the dirty Humans by sending swarms of bugs to crush their home worlds. Evolve your Buggos intro stronger, faster, more murderous creatures that can rip the Human defenses to shreds! No one can stop your evolutionary powers. You are the evil Buggo Hivemind!!!",
